<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fiche Suiveuse — {{ correspondence.reference }} — MCI</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4 portrait;
            margin: 15mm 15mm 15mm 15mm;
        }
        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #111827;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #fff;
        }
        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #0f172a;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .header-left {
            text-align: left;
            width: 55%;
        }
        .header-right {
            text-align: right;
            width: 40%;
        }
        .republic {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 11pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .motto {
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .ministry {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #034426;
            margin-top: 5px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .slip-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .ref-box {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border: 2px solid #0f172a;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .ref-number {
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            font-size: 16pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0f172a;
        }
        .ref-badge {
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: #e2e8f0;
        }
        .urgent {
            background: #fee2e2;
            color: #991b1b;
            border: 1px solid #f87171;
        }
        .meta-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .meta-card {
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #ffffff;
        }
        .meta-card-title {
            font-size: 8pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #64748b;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .meta-value {
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .routing-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 9.5pt;
        }
        .routing-table th {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 8px 6px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 8pt;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: 1px solid #0f172a;
        }
        .routing-table td {
            border: 1px solid #94a3b8;
            padding: 14px 6px;
            vertical-align: top;
            height: 38px;
        }
        .footer-notice {
            margin-top: 25px;
            border-top: 1px dashed #94a3b8;
            padding-top: 10px;
            font-size: 8pt;
            color: #64748b;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .no-print {
            background: #1e293b;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 50;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .btn-print {
            background: #0284c7;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .btn-close {
            background: #475569;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 10pt;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }
        @media print {
            .no-print {
                display: none !important;
            }
            body {
                padding: 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="no-print">
        <div>
            <strong>MCI e-Circuit</strong> — Fiche Suiveuse Officielle (Format Imprimable A4)
        </div>
        <div>
            <button class="btn-print" onclick="window.print()">Imprimer la fiche suiveuse</button>
            <button class="btn-close" onclick="window.close()">Fermer</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Official Letterhead -->
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-left">
            <div class="republic">RÉPUBLIQUE DU TCHAD</div>
            <div class="motto">Unité — Travail — Progrès</div>
            <div class="ministry">MINISTÈRE DU COMMERCE ET DE L'INDUSTRIE</div>
            <div style="font-size: 8.5pt; color: #475569; margin-top: 3px;">
                Canal d'arrivée : <strong>{{ correspondence.entryChannel.label }}</strong>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="header-right">
            <div style="font-size: 9pt; color: #475569;">Plateforme MCI e-Circuit</div>
            <div style="font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 3px;">
                Date d'enregistrement : {{ correspondence.registeredAt ? correspondence.registeredAt|date('d/m/Y H:i') : correspondence.createdAt|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 8.5pt; color: #64748b; margin-top: 3px;">
                Agent : {{ correspondence.registeredBy ? correspondence.registeredBy.fullName : 'Service Courrier' }}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Titre officiel -->
    <div class="slip-title">
        FICHE SUIVEUSE DE COURRIER ENTRANT
    </div>

    <!-- Encadré Référence Officielle -->
    <div class="ref-box">
        <div>
            <div style="font-size: 8pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: bold;">Numéro de référence officiel</div>
            <div class="ref-number">{{ correspondence.reference }}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
            {% if correspondence.priority %}
                {% set isUrgent = correspondence.priority.code in ['URGENTE', 'TRES_URGENTE', 'URGENT'] %}
                <span class="ref-badge {{ isUrgent ? 'urgent' : '' }}">
                    PRIORITÉ : {{ correspondence.priority.label|upper }}
                </span>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Grille des métadonnées -->
    <div class="meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-card">
            <div class="meta-card-title">Expéditeur / Signataire</div>
            <div class="meta-value">{{ correspondence.sender ? correspondence.sender.name : 'Non précisé' }}</div>
            {% if correspondence.sender and correspondence.sender.organisation %}
                <div style="font-size: 9pt; color: #475569; margin-top: 2px;">{{ correspondence.sender.organisation }}</div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if correspondence.sender and correspondence.sender.phone %}
                <div style="font-size: 8.5pt; color: #64748b; margin-top: 2px;">Tél : {{ correspondence.sender.phone }}</div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="meta-card">
            <div class="meta-card-title">Caractéristiques du document</div>
            <div class="meta-value">Nature : {{ correspondence.documentType ? correspondence.documentType.label : 'Courrier' }}</div>
            <div style="font-size: 9pt; color: #475569; margin-top: 2px;">
                Date effective réception : {{ correspondence.receivedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}
            </div>
            {% if correspondence.mainDocument %}
                <div style="font-size: 8.5pt; color: #0284c7; margin-top: 2px;">
                    Pièce jointe : {{ correspondence.mainDocument.originalName }} ({{ (correspondence.mainDocument.size / 1024)|round }} Ko)
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Objet -->
    <div class="meta-card" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
        <div class="meta-card-title">Objet du courrier</div>
        <div class="meta-value" style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.4;">{{ correspondence.subject }}</div>
        {% if correspondence.observations %}
            <div style="margin-top: 6px; font-size: 9pt; color: #475569; border-top: 1px dotted #cbd5e1; padding-top: 4px;">
                <em>Observations : {{ correspondence.observations }}</em>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    <!-- Grille de circulation et de visas administratifs -->
    <div style="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px;">
        Circuit de traitement & Instructions administratives
    </div>

    <table class="routing-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 5%; text-align: center;">N°</th>
                <th style="width: 14%;">Date / Heure</th>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Direction / Service</th>
                <th style="width: 45%;">Instructions / Annotations</th>
                <th style="width: 16%;">Visa & Signature</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">1</td>
                <td>{{ correspondence.receivedAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</td>
                <td>{{ correspondence.entryChannel.label }}</td>
                <td>Enregistrement initial et affectation pour instruction.</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">2</td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">3</td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">4</td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">5</td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">6</td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="footer-notice">
        Fiche suiveuse générée par MCI e-Circuit • Document officiel à joindre impérativement au dossier physique • Toute transmission doit être émargée sur cette fiche et validée sur la plateforme.
    </div>

</body>
</html>
